{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>著名導演王晶近日因公開言論惹火，大批網民怒火無處發洩，竟湧入其愛女王海榛社交平台瘋狂洗版攻擊。身為星二代一直承受極大壓力的她，面對突如其來的公關危機並未退縮。這場原本針對家族的網絡風暴，最終結局走向卻出乎所有人意料之外。</p>\n<h2>王海榛大爆父親王晶極端要求</h2>\n<p>在節目《晚吹－怨女俱樂部》第80集之中，王海榛坦言作為名導女兒經常面臨巨大期望與無形壓力。她透露父親在片場會化身嚴父，甚至曾下達極度嚴苛工作指令，告誡她就算生病亦絕對不可輕易請假，更拋下一句「死都要死返入廠」。這種高壓訓練源於影視圈前輩敬業精神，不少演員即使發高燒依然堅持在台上跳唱，甚至一落台便要馬上坐輪椅上白車送院急救。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入王海榛社交平台洗版當事人冷靜應對</h2>\n<p>早前王晶在網上發表惹火言論引發軒然大波，連累愛女無辜成為網民攻擊目標。王海榛憶述事發當日正與朋友打麻雀，突然收到友人傳來短訊驚呼「你老豆做咩咁爆」，這才驚覺自己社交平台已經淪為戰場。面對海量負評與謾罵留言，她選擇以極度冷靜態度處理，僅僅打開手機查看片刻，便決定不作任何反擊並繼續專心打麻雀，完全未有被網上言論影響心情。</p>\n<h2>王晶鐵漢柔情對愛女王海榛許下一生承諾</h2>\n<p>雖然外界經常將焦點放在兩父女工作上摩擦，但其實這位大導演私下亦有柔情一面。王海榛憶述兩人曾經合作經營YouTube頻道，深知父親性格大情大性，甚至曾因對方將半包朱古力塞入衫袋而直接叫停拍攝。不過最令她感動是一次閒聊期間，父親突然罕有地展露溫柔，對她深情表示「我生得你出，我預咗養你一世」，這句霸氣又窩心說話成為她演藝路上最強大後盾。</p>\n<h2>無懼網絡欺凌意外獲得一萬粉絲流量密碼</h2>\n<p>這場由父親引發網絡風波不但沒有擊垮這位星二代，反而為她帶來意想不到收穫。大批網民原本打算留言狙擊，卻意外被她不卑不亢態度吸引，令其社交平台追蹤人數瞬間暴增1萬人。她自嘲在這場鬧劇中自己才是最大贏家，笑言賺取了最重要流量密碼，目前正積極以內容創作者身份尋找更多幕前演出機會，盼望能夠憑藉自身實力在演藝圈中脫穎而出。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484444645642989_20829107476afb271f8eaab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484444645642989_20829107476afb271f8eaab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445004812506_9012358706afb27227f903.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445004812506_9012358706afb27227f903.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445264783894_13399914466afb272532ec1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445264783894_13399914466afb272532ec1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445617112609_19524922556afb27287bae4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445617112609_19524922556afb27287bae4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445976419514_10556698816afb272c8e6ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484445976419514_10556698816afb272c8e6ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484446242562118_1672580936afb272eef6fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484446242562118_1672580936afb272eef6fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484446595727394_2832675836afb273252c67.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王晶 王海榛 （圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484446595727394_2832675836afb273252c67.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:21:01.031378+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1180,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:54:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:26.523629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:26.523629+00:00","content_hash":"f839711e10df1cf23ddba9362b24994026ec568bead59a11400e6c9404c62909","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}